    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young child named Alex finds himself in a dying world. You are to guide him, protect him, and help him find a way back home. The game knows you exist, and you are able to influence it through unconventional means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be wary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The connection has been initiated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices are permenant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... And the world is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Gameplay mechanics that go beyond the limits of the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique relationship between the game world and the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of fun and unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interesting and immersive narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MILD CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connected Fates contains depictions of somewhat dark themes. Proceed with caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVING THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is saved upon closing the game window. Do not worry, you will be able to pick up where you left off.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young child named Alex finds himself in a dying world. You are to guide him, protect him, and help him find a way back home. The game knows you exist, and you are able to influence it through unconventional means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be wary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The connection has been initiated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices are permenant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... And the world is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Gameplay mechanics that go beyond the limits of the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique relationship between the game world and the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of fun and unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interesting and immersive narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MILD CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connected Fates contains depictions of somewhat dark themes. Proceed with caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVING THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is saved upon closing the game window. Do not worry, you will be able to pick up where you left off.</p>",
